Test Case Type:
Barclays Customer Indicator – Post 01-Aug-2026 Logic

Test Case Long Description:
Validate that from 01-Aug-2026 onwards the Barclays Customer Indicator is derived correctly based on Risk Scorecard Name, and review all populated source scorecard values for unexpected values.

Expected Results:
Records with Risk Scorecard Name of 'GEN 16 BANK' or 'CACS' should be classified as Barclays Customer Indicator = 'Y'. All other values should be classified as 'N'. No incorrectly mapped values should be present.

Actual Results:
Pending execution.

Status:
Pending


WITH VALIDATION AS (
    SELECT
        APPLICATION_DECISION_DATE,
        RISK_SCORECARD_NAME,
        BARCLAYS_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR,
        APPLICATION_COUNT,

        CASE
            WHEN UPPER(TRIM(RISK_SCORECARD_NAME))
                 IN ('GEN 16 BANK', 'CACS')
            THEN 'Y'
            ELSE 'N'
        END AS EXPECTED_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR

    FROM BDP_UK_CARDS.FACT_CARD_AGGREGATOR_APPLICATION_SUMMARY

    WHERE APPLICATION_DECISION_DATE >= DATE '2026-08-01'
)

SELECT
    RISK_SCORECARD_NAME,
    BARCLAYS_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR AS ACTUAL_INDICATOR,
    EXPECTED_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR,

    SUM(COALESCE(APPLICATION_COUNT, 0)) AS APPLICATION_VOLUME,

    CASE
        WHEN BARCLAYS_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR = EXPECTED_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR
        THEN 'PASS'
        ELSE 'FAIL'
    END AS TEST_RESULT

FROM VALIDATION

GROUP BY
    RISK_SCORECARD_NAME,
    BARCLAYS_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR,
    EXPECTED_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR

ORDER BY
    TEST_RESULT DESC,
    APPLICATION_VOLUME DESC;